`,t(e.p,{children:"When you push or pull, filesync walks up from the file looking for the nearest config. If it finds one, that's the repo; if it doesn't, it falls back to your global default. So your private files keep syncing there, the shared ones sync to the team remote, and the two never cross, because the routing is purely about where the file lives on disk."}),`
